        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜AI股反彈 納指升1.1% 道指偏軟",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜AI股反彈 納指升1.1% 道指偏軟\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜AI股反彈 納指升1.1% 道指偏軟</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">人工智能相關股份反彈，帶動納斯達克綜合指數周五上升1.1%，收報24,579.42點。標普500指數升0.3%至7,376.86點，道瓊斯工業平均指數則跌0.5%至51,285.73點。華爾街本周忙於評估美國中期選舉結果對經濟的影響，期間環球股市一度下滑，美股周五表現相對靠穩，美國就業數據理想亦令國債孳息率維持偏高水平。全周計，標普500指數跌2.7%，納指跌3.4%，道指跌0.9%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1-ai%E8%82%A1%E5%8F%8D%E5%BD%88-%E7%B4%8D%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%871-1-%E9%81%93%E6%8C%87%E5%81%8F%E8%BB%9F-220031317.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-07 06:03:43",
